      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The idea that disappearing is the ultimate act of selflessness is a dangerous illusion, but it's a common one when you're in this much pain. Your life has value, even if you can't see it right now, and the weight you feel is a symptom of your struggle, not a reflection of your worth. Instead of ending things, let's focus on finding a way to lift that weight together. Please, reach out to someone who can help you carry this burden instead.",
